{
  "page": 30,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "• If this information is not available online, the authors are encouraged to reach out to",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        75.2083740234375,
        504.0016174316406,
        84.11493682861328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the asset’s creators.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        86.11737060546875,
        240.98129272460938,
        95.02393341064453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "13. New Assets",
      "bbox": [
        126.43099975585938,
        100.89179992675781,
        191.72634887695312,
        109.91791534423828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: Are new assets introduced in the paper well documented and is the documentation",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        115.90533447265625,
        503.9969482421875,
        124.81189727783203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "provided alongside the assets?",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        126.8143310546875,
        264.63262939453125,
        135.72088623046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [NA]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        141.70831298828125,
        201.02110290527344,
        150.6148681640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: The paper does not introduce new assets.",
      "bbox": [
        143.67601013183594,
        156.602294921875,
        360.9603271484375,
        165.50885009765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.8660125732422,
        171.497314453125,
        189.80357360839844,
        180.40386962890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper does not release new assets.",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        186.39129638671875,
        424.0542297363281,
        195.2978515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Researchers should communicate the details of the dataset/code/model as part of their",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        199.29229736328125,
        504.1708068847656,
        208.19891357421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "submissions via structured templates. This includes details about training, license,",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        210.20135498046875,
        505.24969482421875,
        219.10791015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "limitations, etc.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        221.1103515625,
        225.50933837890625,
        230.01690673828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The paper should discuss whether and how consent was obtained from people whose",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        234.0123291015625,
        504.00213623046875,
        242.9189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "asset is used.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        244.92138671875,
        215.53677368164062,
        253.82794189453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• At submission time, remember to anonymize your assets (if applicable). You can either",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        257.8233642578125,
        504.1728820800781,
        266.72991943359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "create an anonymized URL or include an anonymized zip file.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        268.73236083984375,
        410.84356689453125,
        277.638916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "14. Crowdsourcing and Research with Human Subjects",
      "bbox": [
        126.43099975585938,
        283.5068054199219,
        363.79046630859375,
        292.5329284667969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: For crowdsourcing experiments and research with human subjects, does the paper",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        298.5203552246094,
        504.1726379394531,
        307.4269104003906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "include the full text of instructions given to participants and screenshots, if applicable, as",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        309.4293518066406,
        504.0048522949219,
        318.3359069824219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "well as details about compensation (if any)?",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        320.3383483886719,
        318.77899169921875,
        329.2449035644531
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [NA]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        335.23236083984375,
        201.02110290527344,
        344.138916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: The paper does not involve crowdsourcing nor research with human subjects.",
      "bbox": [
        143.67601013183594,
        350.1273498535156,
        505.1987609863281,
        359.0339050292969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.86500549316406,
        365.0213623046875,
        189.8025665283203,
        373.92791748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper does not involve crowdsourcing nor research with",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        379.9153747558594,
        503.9985046386719,
        388.8219299316406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "human subjects.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        390.8243713378906,
        227.989990234375,
        399.7309265136719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Including this information in the supplemental material is fine, but if the main contribu-",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        403.7263488769531,
        505.6545715332031,
        412.6329345703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tion of the paper involves human subjects, then as much detail as possible should be",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        414.6353759765625,
        503.9998779296875,
        423.54193115234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "included in the main paper.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        425.54437255859375,
        271.98480224609375,
        434.450927734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• According to the NeurIPS Code of Ethics, workers involved in data collection, curation,",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        438.44537353515625,
        505.246826171875,
        447.3519287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "or other labor should be paid at least the minimum wage in the country of the data",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        449.3553466796875,
        503.9996643066406,
        458.26190185546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "collector.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        460.2643737792969,
        200.59286499023438,
        469.1709289550781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "15. Institutional Review Board (IRB) Approvals or Equivalent for Research with Human",
      "bbox": [
        126.43099975585938,
        475.0387878417969,
        503.9963073730469,
        484.06494140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subjects",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        485.9477844238281,
        179.84095764160156,
        494.9041748046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Question: Does the paper describe potential risks incurred by study participants, whether",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        500.96136474609375,
        504.1672058105469,
        509.867919921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "such risks were disclosed to the subjects, and whether Institutional Review Board (IRB)",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        511.870361328125,
        504.66259765625,
        520.7769165039062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "approvals (or an equivalent approval/review based on the requirements of your country or",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        522.7793579101562,
        504.1643981933594,
        531.6859130859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "institution) were obtained?",
      "bbox": [
        143.86599731445312,
        533.6883544921875,
        250.675048828125,
        542.5949096679688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: [NA]",
      "bbox": [
        143.5070037841797,
        548.5823364257812,
        201.02110290527344,
        557.4888916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Justification: The paper does not involve crowdsourcing nor research with human subjects.",
      "bbox": [
        143.67601013183594,
        563.4773559570312,
        505.1987609863281,
        572.3839111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Guidelines:",
      "bbox": [
        143.8660125732422,
        578.371337890625,
        189.80357360839844,
        587.2778930664062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• The answer NA means that the paper does not involve crowdsourcing nor research with",
      "bbox": [
        155.32301330566406,
        593.265380859375,
        503.9985046386719,
        602.1719360351562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "human subjects.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        604.1743774414062,
        227.989990234375,
        613.0809326171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• Depending on the country in which research is conducted, IRB approval (or equivalent)",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        617.0763549804688,
        504.6686706542969,
        625.98291015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "may be required for any human subjects research. If you obtained IRB approval, you",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        627.9853515625,
        504.0038146972656,
        636.8919067382812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "should clearly state this in the paper.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        638.8943481445312,
        309.065673828125,
        647.8009033203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• We recognize that the procedures for this may vary significantly between institutions",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        651.7953491210938,
        504.0047912597656,
        660.701904296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and locations, and we expect authors to adhere to the NeurIPS Code of Ethics and the",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        662.704345703125,
        503.9997863769531,
        671.6109008789062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "guidelines for their institution.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        673.6133422851562,
        285.00592041015625,
        682.5198974609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "• For initial submissions, do not include any information that would break anonymity (if",
      "bbox": [
        155.322998046875,
        686.515380859375,
        504.0014953613281,
        695.4219360351562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "applicable), such as the institution conducting the review.",
      "bbox": [
        163.79100036621094,
        697.4243774414062,
        392.0340881347656,
        706.3309326171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
